   "value": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the female fighter in <Picture 1>. Reference role: identity and gear anchor. Features to follow exactly: braided dark hair, black boxing gloves, red fight shorts, a tattoo on the left forearm, and her southpaw stance. Do not carry over the plain studio backdrop of <Picture 1>.\n<Subject 2> is the gym environment in <Picture 2>. Reference role: setting anchor. Features to follow exactly: corrugated metal walls, a row of hanging heavy bags, the crowd of onlookers behind the rope, and warm overhead industrial lighting.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] An eight-second continuous fight-training sequence: <Subject 1> works a heavy bag inside the gym of <Subject 2>, throws combinations and a finishing body kick, then settles into her guard and looks into the lens.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - retain face, braids, gloves, shorts and forearm tattoo; keep exactly one fighter, no doubles and no extra people in the foreground.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): partially_preserved - keep wall texture, the bag row, the crowd and the lighting; allow the camera to move freely inside the space.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe video is live-action, handheld documentary style.\n[Shot 1] [0-3s] Medium shot from slightly below: <Subject 1> slips an imaginary punch, pivots on the front foot and fires a jab-cross-hook combination into the heavy bag. The bag compresses, sweat sprays off her brow, braids whip across her face.\n[Shot 1 continued] [3-6s] The camera arcs low around her as she lands a hard body kick; the bag swings wide on its chain and the crowd behind the rope gasps.\n[Shot 1 continued] [6-8s] She resets into her guard, chest heaving, pushes her braids back with a glove and looks straight into the lens.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nLeather gloves snapping on canvas, heavy bag chain rattling, rhythmic breathing, a coach shouting \"again!\", crowd reactions, low humid room tone. No dialogue.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNone."
